{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"The failure is centered in cart hydration: a deleted SKU was marking the whole cart obsolete, and order rendering was treating the live catalog product as optional rather than the order line snapshot. I’ve changed cart hydration to discard only missing-product lines while preserving the cart, and tightened multi-item cart additions to return 404 for missing SKUs. Next I’m compiling and checking the order render paths."}}
